# 20. Nmap Does NOT Automatically Mean Vulnerability

Suppose Nmap reports:

```text
80/tcp open http
```

This means:

> A service appears to be accessible on TCP port 80.

It does **not** automatically mean:

> The service is vulnerable.

### Correct workflow

```text
Open Port
   ↓
Identify Service
   ↓
Identify Version
   ↓
Assess Potential Vulnerabilities
   ↓
Validate
```

